=\"color: #008000\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin : <strong>07/09/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>28/09/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date :<b>28/09/2026</b></li>\n<li>Form Correction Last Date : <strong>05/10/2026</strong></li>\n<li>UPSSSC Computer Operator Main Exam Date :<span style=\"color: #000000\"><b> As per Schedule</b></span></li>\n<li>Exam City Available : <strong>Before Exam</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>Before Exam</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%;height: 250px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>General (UR) / OBC / EWS : <b>25/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST : <b>25/-</b></li>\n<li>PH (Divyang) : <b>25/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through UPI, Debit Card, Credit Card and Net Banking Mode Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 223px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.103%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>UPSSSC Computer Operator Online Form 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Age Limit as on 01/07/2026</b></span></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>21 Years</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>40 Years&nbsp;</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per UPSSSC Computer Operator Mains Recruitment Rules Advt. No. 20-Exam/2026.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.103%;height: 58px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>UPSSSC Computer Operator Mains Online Form 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Vacancy Details Total : 12 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px\" colspan=\"3\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Total Post</strong></t