.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>6. What is the last date Pay Application fee ?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong>28 September 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>7. How can I apply for UPSSSC Computer Operator Main Exam 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong></strong></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_30879\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-30879\" style=\"width: 2550px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-30879\" title=\"UPSSSC Computer Operator\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/UPSSSC-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"UPSSSC\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1475\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/UPSSSC-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/UPSSSC-300x173.jpg 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/UPSSSC-1024x590.jpg 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/UPSSSC-768x442.jpg 768w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/UPSSSC-1536x885.jpg 1536w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/UPSSSC-2048x1180.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\"><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-30879\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">UPSSSC Co